  "description": "A versatile ride for urban commuters\n\nThe Birdy City provides comfort, flexibility, and style for urban commuters and cyclists looking for a reliable all-around bike. Its full suspension system offers impressive and smooth ride performance on roads and the PCN. It’s also equipped with a Shimano Sora 9-speed derailleur for smooth and efficient shifting, ensuring a superb price-performance ratio.\n\nShimano Sora Derailleur\n\nThe Shimano Sora is a high-quality drivetrain system designed for road bikes. It features smooth and precise shifting performance for tackling any terrain with confidence.\n\nThe 9-speed cassette and chain provide a wide range of gears, allowing you to easily find the perfect gear for your riding style.\n\nAvid BB5 Mechanical Disc Brakes\n\nThe Avid BB5 disc brakes are a reliable and cost-effective braking option featuring a tough melt-forged body, inboard pad adjustment, and a tool-free pad replacement system. Its integrated cable stop reduces the possibility of cable drag.",
